From 5fe09ab56be5fd74f42fe5293fd558fdc1bc61f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "qwen.ai[bot]" <qwenlm-intl@service.alibaba.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 09:45:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ASSUN: populate tab tables from modbus CSV data (embedded
 JSON + client renderer)

- web/data/assun.csv: store user-provided table (271 records, '@'-separated), one record per line; add etalon.csv copy for the Etalon source selector
- web/templates/assun.html: embed parsed table as JSON (script#assunData), load static/assun.js
- web/static/assun.js: render 6-column tables per subtab grouped by Classify
  (1-Basic,2-Current,3-Speed,4-Position,5-Communication,6-Motor,7-Gain,8-Vibration,9-DI/DO,12+13-Read Only);
  editable value inputs (Enter -> POST /api/write), Read All via /api/parameters?regs=..., live values with decimal scaling
- web/server.go: parseAssunCSV switched to line-based parsing (fixes desync when a record has stray separators); default API file is assun.csv
- style.css: register table and subtab styles
---
